WEBVTT

00:00:04.700 --> 00:00:07.735
The Learners tab lists the learners you tutor.

00:00:07.735 --> 00:00:09.187
At first, it is empty.

00:00:09.187 --> 00:00:10.375
Tap, Add learners.

00:00:11.175 --> 00:00:15.027
Choose the school of the learners, then choose the correct grade.

00:00:15.027 --> 00:00:16.983
Please be careful with the grade.

00:00:16.983 --> 00:00:22.673
The tests for each learner are set by this grade, and the grade cannot be changed during a test.

00:00:23.473 --> 00:00:24.458
Choose the group.

00:00:24.458 --> 00:00:26.602
Regular group is for your main class.

00:00:26.602 --> 00:00:32.860
Pull-out is for the two or three weaker learners you tutor separately, who may come from other grade levels.

00:00:33.660 --> 00:00:35.297
Type one name on each line.

00:00:35.297 --> 00:00:39.783
You can also paste a whole list at once, for example from your class list.

00:00:40.583 --> 00:00:41.722
Tap, Save learners.

00:00:41.722 --> 00:00:45.682
The learners now appear in your list, with their grade and school.

00:00:45.682 --> 00:00:49.521
At the top you can see how many learners already have a pretest.

00:00:50.321 --> 00:00:55.040
If your learners are in different grades, add them again, one grade at a time.

00:00:55.040 --> 00:00:59.153
Open Add learners, choose the other grade, type the names, and save.

00:00:59.953 --> 00:01:04.756
To fix a name, a grade, or a group, tap the learner and choose, Edit learner.

00:01:04.756 --> 00:01:07.314
You can also mark a learner who has left.

00:01:07.314 --> 00:01:10.620
Always correct the grade before you give the pretest.
